    <bpmn:process id="W_W3993" name="W3993. Post-Merger Integration (PMI) Strategy, Planning &amp; Synergy Realization" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Signing; pre-close integration planning
Frequency: Per transaction
Volume: Per transaction
Owner: Integration Lead / Head of Corporate Development
Participants: Integration Lead, Corp Dev, all workstreams, COO, CFO, affected business unit, PMO (links to VS-112), Strategy (links to VS-33)
Source: workflow W3993 — Post-Merger Integration (PMI) Strategy, Planning &amp; Synergy Realization</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3993_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3993_Lane1" name="Integration Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3993_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3993_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3993_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3993_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3993_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3993_Start3" name="Signing; pre-close integration planning">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3993_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3993_Task4" name="Integration Lead define the PMI strategy and guiding principles: value-creation…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Integration Lead define the PMI strategy and guiding principles: value-creation thesis, integration intensity (full absorption vs preservation), integration operating model and governance, synergy targets (revenue/cost/financial), and the integration roadmap with value-capture milestones
Responsible (R): Integration Lead / Corp Dev / Strategy
Accountable (A): CEO / Integration Steering
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3993_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3993_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3993_Task5" name="Integration Lead build the integration plan: workstream plans (commercial…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Integration Lead build the integration plan: workstream plans (commercial, operations, finance, HR, IT, legal), synergy-tracking (baseline, target, owner, date), dependencies, risks, and budget — leveraging PMO discipline (links to VS-112) and the Day-1 plan (links to W3994)
Responsible (R): Integration Lead / workstream leads
Accountable (A): Integration Steering
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3993_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3993_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3993_Task6" name="Integration Lead execute synergy realization, track value capture against…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Integration Lead execute synergy realization, track value capture against baseline, manage integration risks, and report progress to the steering committee and Board (links to VS-36)
Responsible (R): Integration Lead / workstreams
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Per transaction + ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3993_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3993_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3993_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3993_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3993_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-622 (ensure controlled execution — Integration, Carve-Out, Divestiture &amp; Post-Merger Performance (PA-130.3).) | - operational: bottom-up tracking and accountability; operational: intensity-tailored approach
Owner: Integration Lead / Head of Corporate Development</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3993_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3993_Annotation8" targetRef="W3993_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3993_Flow10" sourceRef="W3993_Start3" targetRef="W3993_Task4" />
