    <bpmn:process id="W_W3994" name="W3994. Day-1 Readiness, Cutover &amp; Transaction Close Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Approaching closing date
Frequency: Per transaction
Volume: Per transaction
Owner: Integration Lead / VP Legal
Participants: Integration Lead, Legal (links to VS-100), Finance/Treasury, HR, IT, Tax (links to VS-79), Corp Sec (links to VS-36.1), affected business unit, communications (links to VS-14.3)
Source: workflow W3994 — Day-1 Readiness, Cutover &amp; Transaction Close Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3994_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3994_Lane1" name="Integration Lead">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3994_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3994_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3994_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W3994_Lane2" name="Legal">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3994_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3994_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3994_Start4" name="Approaching closing date">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3994_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3994_Task5" name="Integration Lead prepare Day-1 readiness: legal-entity and signatory setup…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Integration Lead prepare Day-1 readiness: legal-entity and signatory setup, bank accounts and treasury (links to VS-18), payroll/HR continuity (links to VS-19), customer/vendor continuity, financial close and consolidation (links to VS-72/VS-17), and Day-1 communications (internal links to VS-103.1; external links to VS-14.3)
Responsible (R): Integration Lead / workstream leads
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3994_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3994_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3994_Task6" name="Legal/Integration-Lead manage closing: conditions-satisfaction (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Legal/Integration-Lead manage closing: conditions-satisfaction (links to W3992), funds flow, signing/closing mechanics, share/asset transfer, and post-close actions checklist
Responsible (R): Legal / Corp Dev / Finance
Accountable (A): VP Legal / CEO
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3994_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3994_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3994_Task7" name="Integration Lead execute Day-1 cutover, stabilize operations, and transition to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Integration Lead execute Day-1 cutover, stabilize operations, and transition to full integration (links to W3993/W3995/W3996)
Responsible (R): Integration Lead
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3994_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3994_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3994_End8" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3994_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3994_Annotation9">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-622 (ensure controlled execution — Integration, Carve-Out, Divestiture &amp; Post-Merger Performance (PA-130.3).) | - operational: Day-1 plan and runbook; operational: tracking and early resolution
Owner: Integration Lead / VP Legal</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
