    <bpmn:process id="W_W3995" name="W3995. Systems, Data &amp; ERP Integration for Acquired Entities" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Post-close integration
Frequency: Per transaction
Volume: Per transaction
Owner: CIO / Integration Lead
Participants: IT (links to VS-27/VS-113), Enterprise Architecture (links to VS-113), Master Data (links to VS-29), Data/Analytics (links to VS-28), ITAM (links to VS-99), affected business unit
Source: workflow W3995 — Systems, Data &amp; ERP Integration for Acquired Entities</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3995_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3995_Lane1" name="IT">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3995_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3995_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3995_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3995_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3995_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3995_Start3" name="Post-close integration">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3995_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3995_Task4" name="IT/EA plan systems integration onto BuildRight&#x27;s unified ERP and enterprise…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: IT/EA plan systems integration onto BuildRight&#x27;s unified ERP and enterprise architecture (links to VS-113): migration vs retirement vs coexistence, integration sequence, master-data harmonization (items, customers, vendors, locations, COA links to VS-29), and security/identity integration (links to VS-27)
Responsible (R): IT / EA / MDM
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3995_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3995_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3995_Task5" name="IT execute the migration/cutover: data cleansing and migration, ERP…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: IT execute the migration/cutover: data cleansing and migration, ERP configuration, integrations (POS/ecommerce/payments/suppliers), testing, and cutover with rollback — minimizing disruption to live trading
Responsible (R): IT / affected BU
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3995_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3995_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3995_Task6" name="IT decommission legacy systems securely (links to VS-99 ITAM/secure retirement…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: IT decommission legacy systems securely (links to VS-99 ITAM/secure retirement and VS-91 data privacy), validate post-cutover, and transition to BAU support (links to VS-27)
Responsible (R): IT / ITAM / Data Privacy
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3995_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3995_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3995_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3995_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3995_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-622 (ensure controlled execution — Integration, Carve-Out, Divestiture &amp; Post-Merger Performance (PA-130.3).) | - operational: cleansing, testing, and rollback; operational: EA-led integration
Owner: CIO / Integration Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
