    <bpmn:process id="W_W3996" name="W3996. Organization, Culture &amp; Change Integration Management" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Post-close integration
Frequency: Per transaction
Volume: Per transaction
Owner: CHRO / Integration Lead
Participants: HR (links to VS-19/VS-102/VS-103), Communications (links to VS-14.3/VS-103.1), affected leaders/managers, Legal, Change Management
Source: workflow W3996 — Organization, Culture &amp; Change Integration Management</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3996_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3996_Lane1" name="HR">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3996_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3996_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3996_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3996_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3996_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3996_Start3" name="Post-close integration">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3996_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3996_Task4" name="HR design the integrated organization: org structure, role mapping and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: HR design the integrated organization: org structure, role mapping and selection process, leadership team, compensation harmonization (links to VS-102), retention of key talent, and any restructuring/retrenchment under DOLE (links to VS-84/VS-19.5)
Responsible (R): HR / Integration Lead
Accountable (A): CHRO / CEO
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3996_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3996_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3996_Task5" name="HR/Communications manage culture and change: vision and narrative, culture…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: HR/Communications manage culture and change: vision and narrative, culture assessment and integration plan, communications cadence (links to VS-103.1), engagement and listening, and adoption of BuildRight&#x27;s standards/code of conduct (links to VS-119)
Responsible (R): HR / Communications
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Per transaction</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3996_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3996_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3996_Task6" name="HR sustain the integration: training and onboarding to BuildRight (links to…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: HR sustain the integration: training and onboarding to BuildRight (links to VS-19.4/VS-123/VS-124), engagement tracking, and remediation of attrition/culture risks
Responsible (R): HR / affected leaders
Accountable (A): CHRO
Duration: Per transaction + ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
