    <bpmn:process id="W_W4000" name="W4000. M&amp;A Portfolio Performance, Value Realization &amp; Lessons-Learned Analytics" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Portfolio cadence; post-close review; deal anniversary
Frequency: Quarterly + annual + per deal close
Volume: M&amp;A portfolio
Owner: Head of Corporate Development / CFO
Participants: Corp Dev, Finance (links to VS-17.4), Strategy (links to VS-33), Integration Leads, Data/Analytics (links to VS-28), CEO, Board (links to VS-36)
Source: workflow W4000 — M&amp;A Portfolio Performance, Value Realization &amp; Lessons-Learned Analytics</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W4000_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W4000_Lane1" name="Corp Dev">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4000_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4000_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4000_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4000_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W4000_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W4000_Start3" name="Portfolio cadence; post-close review; deal anniversary">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4000_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4000_Task4" name="Corp Dev/Finance track each transaction&#x27;s value realization: synergy capture vs…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Corp Dev/Finance track each transaction&#x27;s value realization: synergy capture vs plan, financial performance vs deal model, integration milestones, and value-killer/lesson log
Responsible (R): Corp Dev / Finance / Integration Lead
Accountable (A): CEO
Duration: Quarterly + per deal</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4000_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4000_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4000_Task5" name="Corp Dev run post-deal reviews (90-day, 1-year, anniversaries), capture lessons…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Corp Dev run post-deal reviews (90-day, 1-year, anniversaries), capture lessons learned (DD gaps, integration effectiveness, valuation accuracy), and feed back into the strategy/framework (links to W3977/W3978)
Responsible (R): Corp Dev / Strategy / Integration Lead
Accountable (A): CEO / Board
Duration: Per deal anniversary</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4000_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4000_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W4000_Task6" name="Corp Dev report the M&amp;A portfolio to the Board (links to VS-36): aggregate…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Corp Dev report the M&amp;A portfolio to the Board (links to VS-36): aggregate value created vs invested, hit-rate, integration health, and forward pipeline (links to W3979), and adjust the corporate-development strategy/budget
Responsible (R): Corp Dev / CEO
Accountable (A): Board
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W4000_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W4000_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W4000_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W4000_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W4000_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-622 (ensure controlled execution — Integration, Carve-Out, Divestiture &amp; Post-Merger Performance (PA-130.3).) | - operational: tracking vs deal model; operational: post-deal reviews and feedback loops
Owner: Head of Corporate Development / CFO</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
